{"id":"parado","lemma":"parado","pos":"adj","rank":1566,"glosses":["stopped, halted, immobile, idle","standing","unemployed; on the dole"],"ipa":"/paˈɾado/","forms":{"feminine":"parada","masculinePlural":"parados","femininePlural":"paradas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-parado.wav","formAudio":{"parada":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-parada.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ha parado de llover.","en":"It has stopped raining.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460737"},{"text":"Esta es tu parada.","en":"This is your stop.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799452"},{"text":"Jamás había visto tantos coches parados.","en":"I'd never seen so many stopped cars.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300980"},{"text":"Había tres mujeres paradas en el bar.","en":"There were three women standing at the bar."},{"text":"Actualmente, Tom está parado.","en":"Tom is currently unemployed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/330773"}]}